# Keep build contexts small and reproducible: never ship local state or build output.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
results
var
.git
*.log
# Secrets and local policy material are generated at runtime, never baked into an image.
**/*.key.pem
**/*.key
.env
**/.env
